<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="06">
<name>Brake</name>
<section id="1000N_S0010" variety="S0010">
<name>Brake</name>
<ttl id="1000N_S0010_744XK_T0095" variety="T0095">
<name>Front Flexible Hose NO.1</name>
<para id="RM000000CIU00KX" category="A" type-id="80001" name-id="4510Y-00" from="200612">
<name>Removal</name>
<subpara id="RM000000CIU00KX_03" type-id="11" category="10"/>
<subpara id="RM000000CIU00KX_02" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000CIU00KX_02_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___00007T400000">
<ptxt>Precautions for Brake Line Work</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CIQ00IX"/>)</ptxt>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000000CIU00KX_02_0007">
<ptxt>Remove Front Tire</ptxt>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000000CIU00KX_02_0008">
<ptxt>Drain Brake Fluid</ptxt>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000000CIU00KX_02_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AVF00000">
<ptxt>Remove Front Flexible Hose NO.1</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Hold front brake flexible hose No.1 with a wrench and, using a union nut wrench (10mm), disconnect front brake flexible hose No.1 from the brake tube.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C150127J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Do not bend or damage the brake tube.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not allow foreign matter such as dirt and dust to enter the brake tube connections.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the clip and disconnect front brake flexible hose No.1.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the 2 bolts, and remove the speed sensor bracket and then the flexible hose bracket from the absorber bracket.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C150126J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the union bolt, and remove front brake flexible hose No.1 and the gasket.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C150093" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>